#
# YANG DIUBAH DARI v1.2 — HANYA PENAMBAHAN DI BAGIAN BAWAH:
#
#   + blok /Anabhi-Smart-Play/*  (Service Worker, manifest, cache aset)
#
# TIDAK ADA satu pun aturan v1.2 yang dihapus atau diubah.
# Baris CSP, HSTS, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy, dan seluruh
# aturan cache lama tetap PERSIS seperti semula.
#
# 🔴 CSP TIDAK PERLU DIUBAH untuk Anabhi Smart Play. Sudah kompatibel:
#     script-src  'self' 'unsafe-inline'  -> handler onclick di markup
#     style-src   'self' 'unsafe-inline'  -> gaya inline
#     font-src    'self'                  -> font self-host
#     img-src     'self' data:            -> foto & emoji SVG self-host
#     connect-src 'self' + script.google.com -> laporan ke Apps Script
#     worker-src  'self' blob:            -> pendaftaran Service Worker
#   Seluruh aset aplikasi self-host, jadi tidak ada domain baru yang
#   perlu diizinkan (SOP v1.9 kategori 18.12).
# ================================================================

/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(self), microphone=(), camera=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' blob: https://alcdn.msauth.net https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://fonts.googleapis.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: https:; connect-src 'self' https://login.microsoftonline.com https://graph.microsoft.com https://*.msauth.net https://*.msftauth.net https://www.google-analytics.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com https://cloudflareinsights.com https://script.google.com https://script.googleusercontent.com https://remoteok.com https://www.arbeitnow.com https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com https://fonts.googleapis.com https://*.supabase.co; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'

/*.webp
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.ico
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ANABHI SMART PLAY — /Anabhi-Smart-Play/
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Ditaruh SETELAH aturan umum dengan sengaja. Cloudflare menerapkan
# semua aturan yang cocok, dan untuk nama header yang sama aturan
# yang BELAKANGAN menang. Jadi blok ini menimpa `/*.png` dkk hanya
# pada berkas yang memang tidak boleh di-cache.

# ── Service Worker: JANGAN PERNAH di-cache ──────────────────────
# sw.js yang ter-cache = pengguna terkunci di versi lama selamanya,
# dan tidak bisa diperbaiki dari jarak jauh selain meminta mereka
# membersihkan data aplikasi satu per satu.
/Anabhi-Smart-Play/sw.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
  Content-Type: text/javascript; charset=utf-8

# ── Manifest: Content-Type wajib eksplisit ──────────────────────
# Default Cloudflare mengirim application/json — itu keliru untuk
# manifest dan bisa membuat install PWA gagal.
/Anabhi-Smart-Play/manifest.json
  Content-Type: application/manifest+json; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# ── Halaman utama: selalu revalidate ────────────────────────────
/Anabhi-Smart-Play/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/Anabhi-Smart-Play/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# ── Aset statis ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Aman immutable: berkas js & css selalu diminta dengan ?v=... , dan
# query string membuat URL-nya berbeda setiap kali versi dinaikkan.
/Anabhi-Smart-Play/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/Anabhi-Smart-Play/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/Anabhi-Smart-Play/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# ── Font: butuh CORS walau satu domain (permintaan font selalu CORS) ──
/Anabhi-Smart-Play/assets/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

